      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAGIC SPEED (9) ran well despite being friendless in betting when resuming last time over 1000m at Randwick, finishing third and beaten 1.1 lengths at $51. That form beats these and don't fancy we will see any $51 this time. Taken on top and fancied to make the drop in grade pay. DAWN ON ME (7) scored at her most recent appearance, getting home by a nose over 1010m at Moruya. That continued the good form this campaign, with three wins from six runs. Sure to go well again. STARLIGHT GIRL (4) turned in an eye-catching run last start over 1020m at Moruya, winding up hard from well back on straightening to finish a close third. Sound record at this distance and should be involved in the finish. STUPENDO (6) finished second last start over 1206m at Canberra Acton, beaten 2.5 lengths. Will be rock-hard fit. Sure to be thereabouts.",
